---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SignalField from '../components/SignalField.astro';
import ArticleCard from '../components/ArticleCard.astro';
import { articles } from '../data/articles';
const faqs = [
  ['What is AI visibility?', 'AI visibility is how often—and how accurately—your brand, expertise and content appear in AI-generated answers. It includes brand mentions, cited sources and recommendation context across the questions your audience asks.'],
  ['How is GEO different from SEO?', 'Generative engine optimization focuses on representation in AI answers. SEO focuses on search discovery and performance. Both benefit from accessible pages, clear information and credible evidence, but their outcomes should be measured separately.'],
  ['Can a website guarantee citations in AI answers?', 'No. Answer products use their own retrieval and selection systems, and results can vary between runs. Clear content and sound technical foundations can remove obstacles, but they do not guarantee a mention, citation or recommendation.'],
  ['How should we measure AI visibility?', 'Start with a fixed set of real buyer questions. Record the answer, model or product, date, region and cited URLs. Track mentions, first-party citations and accuracy separately, and repeat comparable tests to understand variability.'],
  ['How does Arrow Signal connect to Arrow AI?', 'Arrow Signal is the AI visibility editorial destination in the Arrow ecosystem. This site connects readers to the main Arrow AI website, Arrow Answers and Arrow AI Tech through clearly identified ecosystem links.'],
];
const schema = { '@type': 'WebSite', name: 'Arrow Signal', url: 'https://arrow-si.com', description: 'AI visibility intelligence and practical GEO education from the Arrow ecosystem.', publisher: { '@id': 'https://arrow-si.com/#organization' } };
---
<Layout title="Arrow Signal — AI Visibility & GEO Intelligence" description="Be the signal. Become the answer. Explore AI visibility, GEO and answer-led discovery with practical guides from the Arrow ecosystem." schema={schema}>
  <section class="hero light-hero">
    <div class="hero-background" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-topline"><span class="hero-pill"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> ARROW SIGNAL / AI VISIBILITY INTELLIGENCE</span></div>
    <div class="hero-body">
      <div class="hero-copy"><h1>Your brand.<br /><em>The answer.</em></h1><p>The next era of discovery is a conversation.<br />Build the signal that puts your expertise in the picture.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="https://arrow-ai.us/geo-check/">Get your GEO check <svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></a><a class="button button-ghost" href="#visibility">Explore AI visibility <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div>
      <SignalField />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-bottom"><span>LESS NOISE. MORE SIGNAL.</span><span>A new perspective. The same Arrow direction.</span><a href="#visibility" aria-label="Scroll to AI visibility">↓</a></div>
  </section>
  <div class="platform-strip"><span>WHERE QUESTIONS BECOME DECISIONS</span><div><span>ChatGPT</span><span>Perplexity</span><span>Gemini</span><span>AI search</span></div><small>Independent editorial coverage. No platform affiliation.</small></div>
  <section class="section film-section">
    <div class="film-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE ARROW POINT OF VIEW / 36 SECONDS</span><h2>SEO ranked you.<br /><span class="serif blue">GEO gets you answered.</span></h2><p>A new interface for discovery. The same need for a clear direction. Watch the original Arrow AI film, then explore the signal behind AI visibility.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://arrow-ai.us/geo/">Explore GEO with Arrow AI <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></a></div>
    <figure class="film-frame"><video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="/brand/arrow-ai-geo-motion-poster.webp" width="1280" height="720" aria-label="Arrow AI film: SEO ranked you. GEO gets you answered." title="Arrow AI — SEO ranked you. GEO gets you answered."><source src="/brand/arrow-ai-geo-motion-light.webm" type="video/webm" /><source src="/brand/arrow-ai-geo-motion-light.mp4" type="video/mp4" /><track kind="descriptions" src="/brand/geo-film.vtt" srclang="en" label="English visual descriptions" /><p><a href="/brand/arrow-ai-geo-motion-light.mp4">Download the Arrow GEO film</a>.</p></video><figcaption>Original Arrow AI motion film. The message is a brand perspective, not a guarantee of AI placement.</figcaption><details class="film-transcript"><summary>Read a summary of the visual story</summary><p>On a dark field of connected points, the film moves from traditional search to people asking AI. An example brand page gives way to GEO—generative engine optimization. The film then shows an illustrative recommendation and source labels, introduces authority, and closes with the Arrow AI logo and website. The recommendation card is a visual illustration, not evidence of an actual AI response.</p></details></figure>
  </section>
  <section id="visibility" class="section visibility-section">
    <div class="section-heading reveal"><span class="eyebrow">01 / THE SHIFT</span><h2>The search bar<br />became <span class="serif blue">a conversation.</span></h2><p>People still search. Now they also ask, compare and decide inside AI answers. Visibility starts with understanding what those answers say about you.</p></div>
    <div class="shift-grid reveal"><div class="old-search"><span class="eyebrow">THE FAMILIAR JOURNEY</span><div class="search-input"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span> Search. Click. Compare.</div><div class="search-result"><span></span><i></i><i></i></div><div class="search-result"><span></span><i></i><i></i></div><p>Your audience assembles the answer.</p></div><div class="shift-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></div><div class="answer-preview"><div class="answer-label"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> THE ANSWER-LED JOURNEY</div><p class="prompt">“How do I make my brand visible in AI answers?”</p><div class="answer-text"><span class="answer-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>Start with a clear identity, useful evidence and content that answers the questions your audience actually asks.</p></div><div class="source-chips"><span>Clear identity</span><span>Credible sources</span><span>Useful answers</span></div><small>Illustration of an answer format, not a live AI response.</small></div></div>
    <div class="three-signals"><div class="reveal"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Be understood.</h3><p>Give your brand a consistent identity. Make your offer, audience and expertise unambiguous.</p></div><div class="reveal"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Be referenced.</h3><p>Create useful explanations and evidence that readers—and retrieval systems—can inspect.</p></div><div class="reveal"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Be considered.</h3><p>Observe the buying questions that matter. Separate a mention from a meaningful recommendation.</p></div></div>
  </section>
  <section id="approach" class="section approach-section">
    <div class="section-heading reveal"><span class="eyebrow">02 / THE SIGNAL METHOD</span><h2>Less guesswork.<br /><span class="serif">A clearer direction.</span></h2><p>A practical loop for AI visibility. Understand the landscape, strengthen the evidence, then observe what changes.</p></div>
    <div class="method-grid"><div class="method-map reveal"><div class="map-cross" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="map-core" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></div><span class="map-label map-label-a">OBSERVE</span><span class="map-label map-label-b">CLARIFY</span><span class="map-label map-label-c">STRENGTHEN</span><span class="map-label map-label-d">REPEAT</span><span class="map-bottom">SIGNAL IS BUILT. NOT ASSUMED.</span></div><div class="method-steps"><div class="reveal"><span>01</span><div><h3>Listen to the answers.</h3><p>Build a baseline from real buyer questions. Capture mentions, citations and how your brand is described.</p><a href="/blog/ai-visibility-baseline/">Build your baseline <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="reveal"><span>02</span><div><h3>Make your expertise legible.</h3><p>Connect a clear identity with focused content, credible sources and a technically accessible site.</p><a href="/blog/answer-ready-content/">Create a stronger source <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="reveal"><span>03</span><div><h3>Follow the evidence.</h3><p>Repeat comparable tests. Use source patterns and representation gaps to choose the next useful action.</p><a href="/blog/30-day-ai-visibility-plan/">Plan your first cycle <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></a></div></div></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="manifesto"><div class="manifesto-lines" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">A POINT OF VIEW FROM ARROW</span><h2>More content<br />isn't the point.<br /><em>A stronger signal is.</em></h2><p>Clarity over volume. Evidence over claims.<br />A direction your audience can trust.</p><a class="button button-white" href="/blog/arrow-ecosystem-ai-visibility/">Meet the Arrow ecosystem <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></a></div><span class="manifesto-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></section>
  <section class="section journal-section"><div class="journal-heading reveal"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 / THE SIGNAL JOURNAL</span><h2>Stay ahead<br />of <span class="serif blue">the answer.</span></h2></div><div><p>Practical thinking on AI visibility.<br />Built to be read. Written to be useful.</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Explore all 15 articles <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="articles-grid">{[articles[0], articles[2], articles[6]].map((article, index) => <ArticleCard article={article} index={index} />)}</div></section>
  <section id="faq" class="section faq-section"><div class="section-heading reveal"><span class="eyebrow">04 / CLEAR ANSWERS</span><h2>A little clarity.<br /><span class="serif blue">A better next step.</span></h2><a class="text-link" href="https://answers.arrow-ai.us/">Continue to Arrow Answers <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></a></div><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
  <section class="ecosystem section"><span class="eyebrow">ONE ECOSYSTEM. A SHARED DIRECTION.</span><div class="ecosystem-grid"><a href="https://arrow-ai.us/"><span>THE MAIN DESTINATION</span><h3>Arrow AI <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></h3><p>Continue your journey with Arrow.</p></a><a href="https://answers.arrow-ai.us/"><span>THE ANSWERS DESTINATION</span><h3>Arrow Answers <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></h3><p>Keep exploring the questions that matter.</p></a><a href="https://arrow-ai.tech/"><span>THE GEO DEMO</span><h3>Arrow AI Tech <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" /></svg></span></h3><p>See the GEO connections come together.</p></a></div></section>
</Layout>
